# A notice that wraps at a narrow width: `✗ command: Unknown command. Try
# /help.` is 38 cells, so at 36 columns fx's notice wrap breaks after the `/`
# of `/help` (scanNoticeLine), where a prose wrap would move `/help.` down
# whole. Typed, so nothing reaches a model.
wait 2
type /nosuch
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 1
snap unknown
